{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jA0jRAM35G1795268551.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流，預料會在晚間逐漸影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港大致多雲，多區氣溫入夜後跌至20度以下。在西九文化區，不少外出的市民都穿上外套保暖。預測明早市區最低氣溫約19度，新界再低兩三度，日間最高氣溫約23度。</p><p></p><p>展望周一多雲，初時風勢仍然頗大。預料東北季候風周二抵達華南沿岸，下周中期氣溫下降及有幾陣雨。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.494425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T15:37:13.075297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:21.729572+00:00","content_hash":"52cb849679265f41fa61aa68ef3d139810812f269a8fe09d27ab884590a3d1ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.494425+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}